      "releaseNotes": "Thanks for using Google Photos. This release includes bug fixes and performance improvements.\n\nWe fixed user-reported issues and added new features to provide a more powerful search experience.",
      "isVppDeviceBasedLicensingEnabled": true,
      "sellerName": "Google LLC",
